  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hydrogen valley workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The hydrogen valley workshop in Algiers supports Algeria in developing a hydrogen strategy that balances large-scale export ambitions with local economic benefits. Currently, Algeria&#x2019;s approach focuses on hydrogen production for international markets, but there is limited integration of domestic value creation, job opportunities, and small- and medium-sized enterprises (SME) participation. This workshop introduces the hydrogen valley approach, leveraging Dutch expertise to demonstrate how hydrogen ecosystems can be structured to support regional economic development. This is done by organising a workshop for 20-35 participants in Algiers that brings together Algerian and Dutch stakeholders to discuss hydrogen ecosystem development in Algeria.</narrative>
  </description>
